{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/d8c7280426ddcc872f2256447fbc91d4.poster.avif?t=1773330624\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/d8c7280426ddcc872f2256447fbc91d4.webm?t=1773330624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/d8c7280426ddcc872f2256447fbc91d4.mp4?t=1773330624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong>WELCOME TO EARTH, UNIT!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Filthium Zero is a compact action roguelite experience featuring a mix of vertical and ground combat. Purge the Filthium-infested Earth, battle hordes of mutants, unlock powerful upgrades to survive, and watch the ragdolls fly in this short and explosive joyride.<br><br><strong>VERTICAL &amp; GROUND COMBAT </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounce off slimes to launch into the air, throw your Extraction Barrel from the sky for a heavy impact, slam yourself down with force, and send ragdolls flying in every direction. Activate and combine powerful abilities, collect resources, and customize the next UNIT with a growing arsenal of upgrades.  <br><br><strong>PURGE, SURVIVE, ADVANCE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: purge the corrupted zones of Earth by extracting Filthium from the water and depositing it into  Collectors, while defeating hordes of zombies and mutants. Each deployment is a new UNIT soldier, armed with upgrades secured by their predecessors. Gather resources, improve survival odds, and push UNIT\u2019s mission forward - one soldier at a time.<br> <br><strong>DEPLOY NOW, UNIT!\u00a0</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Experienced","path"