es.  <br><br><strong>PURGE, SURVIVE, ADVANCE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: purge the corrupted zones of Earth by extracting Filthium from the water and depositing it into  Collectors, while defeating hordes of zombies and mutants. Each deployment is a new UNIT soldier, armed with upgrades secured by their predecessors. Gather resources, improve survival odds, and push UNIT\u2019s mission forward - one soldier at a time.<br> <br><strong>DEPLOY NOW, UNIT!\u00a0</strong></p>","developers":["NoiseHum Games"],"dlc":[4187040],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/0b4342915230377d5d0c0bc19f9d7003ee4e75c4/header.jpg?t=1773330624","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3514090/548915528/dea2656b88fcd383141bfcfbfac5a92f3883fa04/1773127930/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773327080","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3514090/548915528/dea2656b88fcd383141bfcfbfac5a92f3883fa04/1773127930/dash_h264.mpd?t=1773327080","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3514090/548915528/dea2656b88fcd383141bfcfbfac5a92f3883fa04/1773127930/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1773327080","id":257300939,"name":"Filthium Zero: Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257300939/40ef3c73e5d58d541af8d5aa514ed8150ccd308e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1773327080"}],"name":"Filthium Zero","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Filthium Zero - $5.99 USD","packageid":1240599,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":599}],"title":"Buy Filthium Zero"}]